      "value": "Yup. And it is really tedious to cut these little flashes out of your material later. \n\nIt also happens only, when the world your on uses Post Processing. \n\nYou switch the pin, and the Screen flashes for some frames. It may be because, the post processing isn't applying for some frames, and then applies. Resulting in the first frames looking different, what we perceive as a short flash. \n\nPlease fix this. ❤",
